flowchart TB
  accTitle: Moonbase Workbench system boundary
  accDescr: The private browser reaches authenticated HTTP actions and current SSE snapshots. Versioned records feed a server-owned supervisor and only Moonbase-owned native SDK sessions. Explicit approved helpers reach the scoped worktree, while artifacts and receipts return to private state. The optional habitat receives bounded projections and separate read-only Neural Bridge observations.
  Browser["Private browser: Workbench"]
  Auth["Session and RBAC checks"]
  API["HTTP actions and SSE snapshots"]
  State["Versioned private records"]
  Supervisor["Server-owned supervisor"]
  Native["Moonbase-owned SDK session"]
  Workspace["Scoped project worktree"]
  Artifacts["Immutable artifacts and verification receipts"]
  Room["Optional habitat and existing PTYs"]
  Observed["Read-only Neural Bridge observations"]
  Browser --> Auth
  Auth --> API
  API <--> State
  State --> Supervisor
  Supervisor <--> Native
  Native -->|"Explicit approved helpers"| Workspace
  Workspace --> Artifacts
  Artifacts --> State
  Supervisor -->|"Live state"| API
  API -->|"Current receipts"| Browser
  State -->|"Bounded current projection"| Room
  Observed --> Room
